Windows backend setup:

py -3 -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pip install -r Backend\requirements-windows.txt
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m uvicorn Backend.backend.main:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 5000
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m uvicorn main:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000

Or run from the project root:

.\start_backend_windows.ps1

Chrome debug setup:

.\start_chrome_debug_windows.ps1
